// Windows resource script: embeds the multi-resolution application icon into
// hmvchartplotter.exe. Windows Explorer, the taskbar, and the NSIS installer's
// "Add/Remove Programs" entry all read the icon from the executable's resources.
//
// The path is relative to this .rc file; both the MSVC resource compiler
// (rc.exe) and MinGW's windres search the .rc's own directory, so appicon.ico
// (sitting next to this file) resolves under both the local VS2022 build and
// the MSYS2/MinGW CI build. Regenerate the .ico with tools/make_app_icon.py.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "appicon.ico"
